### 001 remote-start-before-the-timer-offers-it
request: POST action.php
request-body: action=timer.remote-start
status: 200
content-type: application/json; charset=utf-8
cache-control: no-store, no-cache, must-revalidate
length: 207
body:
{
    "action": {
        "action": "timer.remote-start"
    },
    "outcome": {
        "summary": "failure",
        "code": "no-remote-start",
        "description": "Remote start not available."
    }
}

### 002 hello-offering-remote-start
request: POST action.php
user-agent: DerbyNet-Timer/golden-1.0 (jar)
request-body: action=timer-message&message=HELLO&remote-start=YES
status: 200
content-type: text/xml; charset=utf-8
cache-control: no-store, no-cache, must-revalidate
length: 187
body:
<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<action-response action="timer-message" message="HELLO" remote-start="YES">
  <success/>
    <query/>
<remote-log send='false'/>
</action-response>

### 003 heartbeat-offering-remote-start
